'''Nezuko Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 849
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nezuko Cat
|name2 = Nezuko Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nezuko Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Nezuko Cat's different forms have slightly different stats between them, but this gimmick falls flat once you realize that most [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating enemies]] are either outranged by both forms, or outrange both forms. This means that for most purposes, the Normal Form will perform better due to a quicker attack rate and marginally higher health in exchange for a little bit of range.

As for her actual usage, it is limited at best. Better alternatives for crowd-controlling Floating enemies exist, such as [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] for slowing them or [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necro-Dancer Cat]] for freezing, though her Area Attack makes her at least a little better than [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Doctor Cat]]. She is best used against [[Teacher Bun Bun]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3's [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] and some easier Cyclone stages if obtained early on, and promptly forgotten about afterwards.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Crowd-Controller}}

